```text
  int[] amounts = new int[3];
    → heap: [0, 0, 0] (3 contiguous int slots)
    → amounts.length = 3 (fixed, cannot change)
    → amounts[0] = first, amounts[2] = last
    → amounts[3] = ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException

  int[] amounts = {50000, 12000, 8000};
    → heap: [50000, 12000, 8000]
    → shorthand for new int[]{50000, 12000, 8000}
```
